TEXT 80 608 Left 2 ;Six-bit R-2R ladder. Resistors are 1k (R) and 2k (2R).
TEXT 80 640 Left 2 ;Independent voltage sources stand in for six digital input pins.
TEXT 80 672 Left 2 ;Each 100 us code step forms the demonstrated rising staircase.
